        "chapter": "Look what you can do now",
        "text": "We set out to recognise, create and explain equivalent fractions. You can split or group equal parts, change both numbers together, and check that the amount stays the same. How many names can you find for one half? Explore the practice on Math Magic.",
        "role": "recap",
        "equation": null,
